# CLUSTER run (2026-11-09; user: "pretrain projection layer with imitation learning using
# demo data like c0 before - freeze and start town05_town01 SAC train - move work to
# cluster"): slurm/sac_c0_plain_rs10_rw_proj.env -- the plain-SAC fine-tune of c0 on Town05
# + Town01 at once, DrQ's 50-d critic input head, uniform-random start steps, c0's demos of
# the two towns pinned in the replay, rewards x10 in the env, in-job evals -- with that head
# PRETRAINED BY IMITATION on the same demos and FROZEN:
#   * before the critic warm-up, one head (Linear -> 50 -> LayerNorm -> tanh on the critic's
#     own input [h | state]) and an actor-sized decoder (256-256) learn the expert's label
#     action with c0's cloning loss (the pre-tanh Gaussian NLL of bc_trainer.bc_loss), the
#     trunk frozen, for CRITIC_PROJ_PRETRAIN_UPDATES updates of 32 chunks x 40 steps; the head
#     with the best validation NLL (episodes split off, as c0's checkpoint was chosen) is kept;
#   * it is copied into all 10 critics and their targets and frozen (CRITIC_PROJ_FREEZE=1):
#     the critic warm-up and SAC then train only the critic MLPs on top of it.
# Why: online, the head's critic learned which way to steer only from the actor's crashes
# and never how much; trained by TD on the demos alone it learned neither (best steering vs
# the expert's: corr +0.04, full lock in 56% of states). The cloning objective makes its 50
# features carry what the expert does in each state.
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_c0_plain_rs10_rw_proj.env"
export CRITIC_PROJ_PRETRAIN_UPDATES=10000 CRITIC_PROJ_PRETRAIN_CHUNKS=32 CRITIC_PROJ_FREEZE=1
